        },
        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "ATV Quad Power Racing is the sequel to ATV Quad Power Racing on the Playstation, with many new features: Choose from 10 of the top professional riders from all over the world, including Dana Creech, Kory Ellis and Tim Farr. Race through 17 massive tracks and five environments, located in challenging countries throughout the world. Get dirty and physically fight with opponents to the finish line, letting them know that you're king off-road. Over-the-top controls and game physics, allowing players to pull huge air and amazingly fun power slides. More than 20 freestyle tricks to let riders express their wild side while tearing up the competition. Several multi-player modes of play, brings the action to players and their friends. Real-life in-game sponsors, adding to the realism of the game.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "ATV Quad Power Racing es la secuela de ATV Quad Power Racing para PlayStation, con numerosas funciones nuevas: elige entre 10 de los mejores pilotos profesionales de todo el mundo, entre ellos Dana Creech, Kory Ellis y Tim Farr. Corre por 17 circuitos enormes y cinco entornos, ubicados en países exigentes de todo el mundo. Ensúciate y lucha físicamente con los rivales hasta la meta, dejándoles claro que eres el rey del campo traviesa. Controles exagerados y físicas del juego que permiten realizar grandes saltos y deslizamientos espectacularmente divertidos. Más de 20 acrobacias de estilo libre para que los pilotos muestren su lado salvaje mientras destrozan a la competencia. Varios modos multijugador que llevan la acción a los jugadores y a sus amigos. Patrocinadores reales dentro del juego, que añaden realismo.",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
